Subject: [PATCH] fonts: font enumeration follows the profile allowlist

A family the host has but the profile's fonts.enumeration_allowlist
omits is hidden from every page probe: document.fonts.check(), canvas
and CSS text measurement, @font-face local() and queryLocalFonts(). All
of them ask one predicate, Profile::FontFamilyEnumerable, so they always
agree. The filter only removes fonts, since a family the host lacks
cannot be made to render. Generic families, character fallback and web
fonts are left as is, because filtering them would break ordinary pages.

--- a/base/apostate/profile.h
+++ b/base/apostate/profile.h
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #include <set>
 #include <optional>
 #include <string>
+#include <string_view>
 #include <vector>
 
 #include "base/base_export.h"
@@ -355,6 +356,27 @@
